      "id": "claim_86619075c3ac4d4789abd0776d3b2ae7",
      "statement": "Model routing has three modes in precedence order: BYOK through the connected user's own account default AI Gateway (cf-aig-authorization with the aig.run scope) — honored regardless of whether a platform gateway exists so connected users are always billed correctly — then the platform AI Gateway free tier (the config's own credentials ignored), then direct provider access with the config's credentials.",
