      "id": "claim_929fd478cbd74454bd57d837c0c52ca9",
      "statement": "In platform-gateway mode every provider including Workers AI rides the same gateway with the same log route and attribution metadata, and the model handle carries the aiGatewayLogRoute so per-request cost is read back from the gateway's logs; gateway inference auth suppresses the SDKs' own auth headers so the gateway's server-managed provider keys apply.",
