      "id": "claim_b7c3cadda9924bf5afc642daaf05f120",
      "statement": "The WORKERS_AI binding can serve as the gateway transport (pre-authenticated, no API token) only when the gateway lives in the Worker's own account — unverifiable at runtime, hence the CF_AI_GATEWAY_USE_BINDING=false opt-out — and unbinding WORKERS_AI is not an alternative because it also backs webFetch's toMarkdown; the Google provider's pi adapter refuses a custom fetch entirely, so CF_AI_GATEWAY_API_TOKEN is always required when google is an enabled provider.",
